1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Your check engine light is on.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Idle feels rough.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Engine hesitates when you accelerate.

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Idle dips or shakes at a stop.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,500
One clue: a clogged EGR valve.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Carbon buildup can block it from closing right.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
That can trip a P0401 code —

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
and it may not clear on its own.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Don't guess which part it is.

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
A scan tool narrows it down fast.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Worth checking before it fails an emissions test.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stop by and we'll take a look — Nick's Tire & Auto.
